WEBVTT

00:09.277 --> 00:10.511
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.578 --> 00:12.346
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.413 --> 00:13.914
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.981 --> 00:15.616
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.683 --> 00:18.819
* OH... *
* 哦... *

00:18.886 --> 00:20.888
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.954 --> 00:22.890
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.956 --> 00:25.193
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.259 --> 00:26.794
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.860 --> 00:28.996
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.063 --> 00:30.464
* SPONGEBOB SQUARE PANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝方形裤子！ *

00:30.531 --> 00:33.033
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.101 --> 00:34.868
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.935 --> 00:36.804
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.870 --> 00:39.807
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:39.873 --> 00:40.841
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:40.908 --> 00:43.277
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:43.344 --> 00:45.613
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.679 --> 00:49.117
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.183 --> 00:51.051
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:03.997 --> 01:05.733
MRS. PUFF'S BOATING SCHOOL
太太。普芙划船学校

01:05.799 --> 01:10.538
WHERE DILIGENT STUDENTS LEARN
THE RULES OF THE ROAD.
勤奋的学生学习的地方
交通规则。

01:10.604 --> 01:11.705
Mrs. Puff:
EVERYONE
泡芙女士：
大家

01:11.772 --> 01:13.307
PUT DOWN YOUR BOOKS
放下你的书

01:13.374 --> 01:18.011
BECAUSE IT'S TIME TO PICK OUT
THE HALL MONITOR OF THE DAY!
因为是时候选择了
当今的大厅监视器！

01:19.213 --> 01:20.681
LET'S SEE HERE.
让我们看看这里。

01:20.748 --> 01:22.750
THIS WEEK'S HALL MONITOR
WILL BE...
本周大厅监控
将会...

01:22.816 --> 01:25.018
BART, JIMMY, NO, NO
巴特，吉米，不，不

01:25.153 --> 01:27.921
TINA, RALPH, HMM... ( gasps )
蒂娜、拉尔夫、嗯……（喘气）

01:27.988 --> 01:30.958
( in quaking voice ):
SPONGEBOB.
（声音颤抖）：
海绵宝宝。

01:31.024 --> 01:32.393
( chair squeaks )
（椅子吱吱作响）

01:32.460 --> 01:33.727
IT'S JIMMY.
这是吉米。

01:33.794 --> 01:35.729
JIMMY'S THE HALL MONITOR.
吉米是大厅监视器。

01:35.796 --> 01:37.865
MRS. PUFF, I'VE DONE IT ALREADY.
太太。噗，我已经做到了。

01:37.931 --> 01:38.632
( chair squeaks )
（椅子吱吱作响）

01:38.699 --> 01:40.634
OH-- PHIL?
哦——菲尔？

01:40.701 --> 01:42.403
NO WAY,
MRS. PUFF.
没办法，
夫人。噗。

01:42.470 --> 01:44.972
UH, TINA--
YOU'RE THE HALL MONITOR.
呃，蒂娜——
您是大厅监控员。

01:45.038 --> 01:47.241
HEY, I'VE DONE IT
THREE TIMES ALREADY.
嘿，我已经做到了
已经三次了。

01:47.308 --> 01:49.009
( chair squeaks )
（椅子吱吱作响）

01:49.076 --> 01:50.010
B-BETH...
B-贝斯...

01:50.077 --> 01:51.212
Boy:
SHE GRADUATED.
男孩：
她毕业了。

01:51.279 --> 01:52.213
HENRY! ( squeak )
亨利！ （吱吱声）

01:52.280 --> 01:53.547
VERA! ( squeak )
维拉！ （吱吱声）

01:53.614 --> 01:54.748
CLAYTON!
克莱顿！

01:54.815 --> 01:57.885
( chair squeaking
repeatedly )
（椅子吱吱作响
反复）

01:57.951 --> 01:59.019
( sighs )
（叹气）

01:59.086 --> 02:01.722
ALL RIGHT, I GUESS
I HAVE NO CHOICE.
好吧，我猜
我别无选择。

02:01.789 --> 02:03.056
( gulps )
（咽了口口水）

02:03.191 --> 02:06.227
THE HALL MONITOR OF THE DAY
IS...
当今的大厅监视器
是……

02:06.294 --> 02:09.330
OH... SPONGEBOB.
哦...海绵宝宝。

02:09.963 --> 02:12.300
YA...HOO!
呀...呼！

02:12.366 --> 02:13.801
HALL MONITOR SPONGEBOB
霍尔监视器海绵宝宝

02:13.867 --> 02:15.536
REPORTING
FOR DUTY, MA'AM.
报告
为了职责，女士。

02:15.603 --> 02:17.571
I'M READY
TO ASSUME MY POSITION
我准备好了
担任我的职务

02:17.638 --> 02:19.006
IN THE HALL.
在大厅里。

02:19.072 --> 02:21.609
I WILL PROTECT ALL
THAT ARE WEAK... IN THE HALL.
我会保护所有人
大厅里的人很弱。

02:21.675 --> 02:24.011
ALL RULES WILL BE ENFORCED...
IN THE HALL.
所有规则都将得到执行...
在大厅里。

02:24.077 --> 02:25.213
OKAY!
好的！

02:25.246 --> 02:26.980
JUST TAKE THE HAT AND BELT.
只需带上帽子和腰带即可。

02:27.047 --> 02:29.283
I CAN'T ACCEPT
THAT YET, MA'AM.
我不能接受
到目前为止，女士。

02:29.350 --> 02:30.818
I HAVE TO MAKE MY SPEECH.
我必须发表演讲。

02:30.884 --> 02:32.986
YOU CAN'T MAKE THIS EASY,
CAN YOU?
你不能让这变得容易，
你可以吗？

02:33.053 --> 02:35.223
CLASSMATES!
同学们！

02:35.256 --> 02:38.492
WHO AM I TO DESERVE
SUCH A GREAT HONOR?
我值得谁
这么大的荣誉？

02:38.559 --> 02:40.894
WHY, I WOULD
BE NOTHING
为什么，我会
什么都不是

02:40.961 --> 02:42.896
WITHOUT MRS. PUFF.
没有夫人。噗。

02:42.963 --> 02:44.532
GIVE ME A BREAK.
让我休息一下。

02:44.598 --> 02:46.099
AND TO MY PUBLIC
以及我的公众

02:46.234 --> 02:50.137
ALL I CAN SAY IS I'M TOUCHED.
我只能说我很感动。

02:50.238 --> 02:51.138
AND FURTHERMORE
而且更进一步

02:51.239 --> 02:52.940
I WILL CARRY
OUT MY DUTIES...
我会携带
我的职责...

02:53.006 --> 02:57.611
CRIME AND PUNISHMENT,
PUNISHMENT AND CRIME
罪与罚，
惩罚与犯罪

02:57.678 --> 02:58.912
IN THE HALL.
在大厅里。

02:58.979 --> 03:01.482
WHICH REMINDS ME
OF AN EXTREMELY
LONG SPEECH
这让我想起了
一个极端的
长篇演讲

03:01.549 --> 03:03.551
WRITTEN BY THE
GREATEST HALL MONITOR
撰写者
最伟大的大厅监听器

03:03.617 --> 03:04.752
OF ALL TIME.
有史以来的。

03:04.818 --> 03:07.488
"FRIENDS, STUDENTS,
JUVENILE DELINQUENTS
“朋友们、学生们，
少年犯

03:07.555 --> 03:08.689
LEND ME YOUR EARS."
把你的耳朵借给我。”

03:08.756 --> 03:10.524
( snoring )
（打鼾）

03:10.591 --> 03:13.794
IN CONCLUSION
AND WITHOUT A MOMENT TO SPARE
结论
一刻不停

03:13.861 --> 03:18.098
I WILL PUT ON THIS UNIFORM
AND ASSUME MY DUTIES AS...
我会穿上这件制服
并承担我的职责...

03:18.832 --> 03:21.101
HALL MONITOR!
大厅监视器！

03:22.536 --> 03:24.372
WISH ME LUCK, MRS. PUFF.
祝我好运，夫人。噗。

03:24.438 --> 03:26.407
OH, AND I WILL BE...
哦，我会...

03:26.474 --> 03:27.475
( bell dings )
（铃声响起）

03:29.310 --> 03:31.879
SPONGEBOB, ARE YOU OKAY?
海绵宝宝，你还好吗？

03:31.945 --> 03:34.181
I OVERDID THE SPEECH AGAIN,
DIDN'T I?
我又夸夸其谈了，
我不是吗？

03:34.282 --> 03:35.616
I'M AFRAID SO.
我恐怕是这样。

03:35.683 --> 03:37.718
AW, TARTAR SAUCE!
哇，鞑靼酱！

03:37.785 --> 03:40.588
I GUESS I WON'T BE NEEDING THIS.
我想我不需要这个。

03:40.654 --> 03:42.690
I HARDLY KNEW YE.
我几乎不认识你。

03:47.495 --> 03:49.930
UH... SPONGEBOB?
呃……海绵宝宝？

03:49.997 --> 03:51.899
YES, MRS. PUFF?
是的，夫人。噗？

03:51.965 --> 03:56.069
I CAN AT LEAST LET YOU
WEAR IT UNTIL TOMORROW.
我至少可以让你
穿着它直到明天。

03:56.136 --> 03:57.104
YAHOO!
雅虎！

03:57.170 --> 03:59.707
THANKS, MRS. PUFF.
谢谢，夫人。噗。

03:59.773 --> 04:03.911
WHAT ARE THE CONSEQUENCES
OF WHAT I'VE JUST DONE?
后果是什么
我刚刚做了什么？

04:03.977 --> 04:04.912
( shudders )
（颤抖）

04:04.978 --> 04:06.347
( sighs )
（叹气）

04:06.414 --> 04:08.015
( humming )... HALL
（嗡嗡声）...大厅

04:08.081 --> 04:10.017
( humming )... MONITOR.
（嗡嗡声）...监视。

04:10.083 --> 04:11.319
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

04:11.319 --> 04:12.520
( horns honking )
（喇叭鸣响）

04:12.586 --> 04:13.887
BROKEN TRAFFIC LIGHT.
交通灯坏了。

04:13.954 --> 04:16.324
WHO'S TO SAY
MY MONITOR DUTIES SHOULD END
谁说的
我的监控职责应该结束

04:16.357 --> 04:17.991
JUST BECAUSE THE BELL RANG?
就因为铃声响了？

04:18.058 --> 04:19.793
I CAN BE HELPFUL ANYWHERE.
我可以在任何地方提供帮助。

04:19.860 --> 04:22.696
THIS LOOKS LIKE A JOB
FOR THE HALL MONITOR!
这看起来像是一份工作
对于大厅监视器！

04:24.632 --> 04:26.900
( blows whistle )
（吹口哨）

04:26.967 --> 04:30.638
( blowing whistle rhythmically )
（有节奏地吹口哨）

04:54.362 --> 04:57.765
WHAT WOULD THIS TOWN DO
WITHOUT YOU, SPONGEBOB?
这个小镇会做什么
没有你，海绵宝宝？

04:57.831 --> 04:58.766
Man:
MY LEGS!
男士：
我的腿！

04:58.832 --> 05:01.268
MY LEGS!
我的腿！

05:01.369 --> 05:02.269
* ON PATROL *
* 巡逻 *

05:02.370 --> 05:04.204
* I'M ON PATROL... *
* 我正在巡逻... *

05:04.271 --> 05:06.474
UH-OH, AN OPEN WINDOW.
呃-哦，一扇打开的窗户。

05:08.376 --> 05:10.911
MORE SEAWEED MEDLEY,
DEAR?
更多海藻杂烩，
亲爱的？

05:10.978 --> 05:12.212
THE FOOLS.
傻瓜们。

05:12.279 --> 05:15.248
THEY'VE LEFT THEMSELVES
SUSCEPTIBLE TO DANGER.
他们离开了自己
容易受到危险。

05:15.383 --> 05:17.785
I MUST SHOW THEM
THE ERROR OF THEIR WAYS
我必须向他们展示
他们的做法所犯的错误

05:17.851 --> 05:19.520
THROUGH EXAMPLE.
通过例子。

05:19.587 --> 05:22.122
( SpongeBob screams )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

05:22.189 --> 05:25.759
I'M THE OPEN WINDOW MANIAC!
我是开窗狂人！

05:25.826 --> 05:28.396
( both screaming )
（两人都尖叫）

05:28.429 --> 05:31.632
I HOPE YOU LEARNED
A VALUABLE LESSON!
我希望你学到了
宝贵的一课！

05:34.034 --> 05:35.302
* ON PATROL *
* 巡逻 *

05:35.403 --> 05:36.837
* I'M ON PATROL *
*我在巡逻*

05:36.904 --> 05:37.871
* I'M ON PATROL... *
* 我正在巡逻... *

05:37.938 --> 05:38.906
( gasps )
（喘气）

05:38.972 --> 05:40.173
VANDALS!
破坏者！

05:40.240 --> 05:41.409
ANOTHER CRIME.
另一种犯罪。

05:44.011 --> 05:45.413
( smacking his lips )
（咂嘴）

05:45.446 --> 05:47.548
HMM... STRAWBERRY.
嗯...草莓。

05:47.615 --> 05:48.882
I MUST ACT.
我必须采取行动。

05:52.553 --> 05:53.521
PATRICK...
帕特里克...

05:53.587 --> 05:54.588
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

05:56.189 --> 05:57.257
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

05:57.324 --> 05:59.026
MY ICE CREAM-- IT'S ALIVE!
我的冰淇淋——它是活的！

05:59.092 --> 06:00.828
( screams )
（尖叫声）

06:00.894 --> 06:02.430
PATRICK, DOWN HERE.
帕特里克，在这儿。

06:02.463 --> 06:04.732
OH, SPONGEBOB, IT'S YOU.
哦，海绵宝宝，是你。

06:04.798 --> 06:06.900
PATRICK, COME DOWN HERE.
帕特里克，下来。

06:08.836 --> 06:10.337
SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝...

06:10.438 --> 06:11.772
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

06:11.839 --> 06:12.906
I'M DOWN HERE.
我在这儿。

06:14.642 --> 06:16.444
YOU LOOK FUNNY.
你看起来很有趣。

06:17.478 --> 06:18.946
HI, SPONGEBOB.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

06:19.012 --> 06:21.348
THAT'S "HALL MONITOR"
TO YOU.
这就是“霍尔监视器”
给你。

06:21.449 --> 06:23.150
SORRY, OFFICER.
对不起，警官。

06:23.216 --> 06:24.952
SORRY'S NOT GOOD ENOUGH,
PATRICK.
抱歉还不够好，
帕特里克。

06:25.018 --> 06:26.520
YOU'VE JUST
COMMITTED A CRIME
你刚刚
犯罪

06:26.587 --> 06:27.788
AND I'M TAKING YOU IN.
我要带你进去。

06:27.855 --> 06:28.956
WHAT CRIME?
什么犯罪？

06:30.190 --> 06:32.359
I'M A BAD PERSON.
我是个坏人。

06:32.460 --> 06:33.861
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

06:33.927 --> 06:36.129
Newspaper boy
( in high voice ):
EXTRA! EXTRA!
报童
（高声）：
额外！额外的！

06:36.196 --> 06:37.631
MANIAC STRIKES
BIKINI BOTTOM!
疯狂的罢工
比基尼泳裤！

06:37.698 --> 06:39.467
CITY PARALYZED WITH FEAR!
城市因恐惧而瘫痪！

06:39.467 --> 06:41.368
( in gruff voice ):
TELL YOUR FRIENDS.
（粗声粗气）：
告诉你的朋友。

06:41.469 --> 06:43.904
ARM YOURSELVES
WITH KNOWLEDGE.
武装自己
凭借知识。

06:43.971 --> 06:45.305
EXTRA! EXTRA...
额外的！额外的...

06:45.372 --> 06:49.142
HMM... "MANIAC...
BIKINI BOTTOM...
嗯……“疯子……
比基尼泳裤...

06:49.209 --> 06:51.378
CAR WRECKS... BREAK-IN."
车祸……闯入。”

06:51.479 --> 06:54.548
WHO BETTER TO BRING
THIS MANIAC TO JUSTICE
最好带谁
将这个疯子绳之以法

06:54.615 --> 06:57.718
THAN ME...
THE HALL MONITOR!
比我...
大厅监视器！

06:57.785 --> 06:59.620
BUT I CAN'T HANDLE
THIS CASE ALONE.
但我无法处理
仅此案。

06:59.687 --> 07:00.888
PATRICK,
ARE YOU READY
帕特里克，
你准备好了吗

07:00.954 --> 07:03.491
TO GIVE UP
YOUR LIFE OF CRIME?
放弃
你的犯罪生涯？

07:03.491 --> 07:05.726
I WANT TO BE GOOD!
我想成为好人！

07:05.793 --> 07:09.930
HMM... NOW YOU JUST NEED
A SYMBOL OF AUTHORITY.
嗯......现在你只需要
权力的象征。

07:13.501 --> 07:14.502
PERFECT.
完美的。

07:14.535 --> 07:16.336
IT IS OUR DUTY
TO CATCH THIS MANIAC
这是我们的责任
抓住这个疯子

07:16.403 --> 07:17.805
AND BRING HIM TO JUSTICE.
并将他绳之以法。

07:17.871 --> 07:19.740
BUT HOW TO PROCEED?
但如何进行？

07:19.807 --> 07:21.942
LISTEN, DEPUTY,
YOU'RE AN EX-CRIMINAL--
听着，副手，
你是一名前科犯——

07:22.009 --> 07:23.877
WHAT WOULD YOU DO?
你会怎么办？

07:23.944 --> 07:24.878
HMM...
唔...

07:24.945 --> 07:26.246
I'D GET AN ICE CREAM.
我要一个冰淇淋。

07:27.848 --> 07:31.284
( both licking loudly )
（两人都大声舔）

07:31.351 --> 07:32.520
OKAY, NOW WHAT?
好吧，现在怎么办？

07:32.586 --> 07:33.587
HMM...
唔...

07:36.389 --> 07:37.525
THIS ISN'T WORKING.
这是行不通的。

07:37.525 --> 07:39.259
WE'VE GOT TO DO
SOMETHING ELSE.
我们必须做
还有别的事。

07:39.326 --> 07:41.194
SOMETHING WITH...
WALKIE-TALKIES!
一些与...
对讲机！

07:41.261 --> 07:42.530
( squeals )
（尖叫声）

07:42.530 --> 07:44.397
AND NOW DUTY CALLS.
现在是值班。

07:44.532 --> 07:46.333
ALL RIGHT, DEPUTY,
I'LL GO THAT WAY
好吧，副手，
我就那样走

07:46.399 --> 07:47.801
YOU GO SOME
DIFFERENT WAY.
你去一些
不同的方式。

07:47.868 --> 07:48.869
GERONIMO!
杰罗尼莫！

07:48.936 --> 07:50.838
( imitates police siren )
（模仿警笛）

07:53.974 --> 07:56.076
( police siren approaching )
（警笛靠近）

07:56.143 --> 07:57.277
( tires squeal )
（轮胎吱吱声）

07:57.344 --> 07:58.612
AFTERNOON, SON.
下午，儿子。

07:58.679 --> 07:59.947
HELLO, BROTHERS.
哈喽，兄弟们。

08:03.684 --> 08:05.819
SON, WE'RE LOOKING
FOR THE MANIAC.
儿子，我们正在寻找
对于疯子来说。

08:05.886 --> 08:09.156
HAVE YOU SEEN THIS MAN?
你见过这个人吗？

08:09.222 --> 08:10.223
( screams )
（尖叫声）

08:10.290 --> 08:11.391
IT'S THE MANIAC!
这就是疯子！

08:11.458 --> 08:13.293
TAKE HIM AWAY,
TAKE HIM AWAY.
把他带走，
把他带走。

08:13.360 --> 08:15.362
CALM DOWN, SON,
IT'S JUST A DRAWING
冷静点，儿子，
这只是一张图

08:15.428 --> 08:16.463
NOT THE REAL THING.
不是真实的东西。

08:16.564 --> 08:17.998
NOW WE'RE
GOING TO SHOW YOU
现在我们是
将向您展示

08:18.065 --> 08:20.100
THIS PICTURE AGAIN
AND YOU'LL TELL US
又是这张照片
你会告诉我们

08:20.167 --> 08:22.235
IF YOU'VE SEEN
THIS GUY, UNDERSTAND?
如果你见过
这家伙，明白吗？

08:22.302 --> 08:23.737
YEAH, UH-HUH.
是啊，嗯。

08:23.804 --> 08:25.573
OKAY.
好的。

08:25.639 --> 08:26.574
( screams )
（尖叫声）

08:26.640 --> 08:27.741
HORRIBLE!
可怕！

08:29.710 --> 08:31.579
( screams again )
（再次尖叫）

08:32.880 --> 08:37.017
( stops and starts
screaming repeatedly )
（停止和开始
反复尖叫）

08:40.988 --> 08:42.089
STAY INDOORS, SON.
呆在室内，儿子。

08:42.155 --> 08:45.358
AND TAKE THAT CONE
OFF YOUR HEAD.
拿走那个圆锥体
摆脱你的头脑。

08:45.425 --> 08:47.961
( both chuckle )
（两人都笑了）

08:50.197 --> 08:53.233
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

08:53.300 --> 08:54.334
Come in, SpongeBob.
进来吧，海绵宝宝。

08:54.401 --> 08:55.368
Answer!
回答！

08:55.435 --> 08:56.737
SPONGEBOB HERE, PATRICK.
海绵宝宝在这里，帕特里克。

08:56.804 --> 08:58.071
REPORT.
报告。

08:58.138 --> 09:00.207
I don't want to be
a policeman anymore.
我不想成为
不再是警察了

09:00.273 --> 09:01.474
I'm scared.
我很害怕。

09:01.609 --> 09:03.310
GET A HOLD OF YOURSELF, DEPUTY.
控制住自己，副手。

09:03.376 --> 09:06.413
( Patrick sobbing )
（帕特里克抽泣）

09:06.479 --> 09:09.717
I want to go home!
我想回家！

09:09.783 --> 09:11.018
POOR ROOKIE.
可怜的菜鸟。

09:11.084 --> 09:12.786
ALL RIGHT, I'M ON MY WAY BACK.
好吧，我正在回来的路上。

09:12.853 --> 09:14.387
HURRY, SPONGEBOB.
快点，海绵宝宝。

09:14.454 --> 09:16.389
I THINK IT'S GETTING...
我认为它正在变得……

09:16.456 --> 09:17.725
DARK.
黑暗的。

09:17.791 --> 09:20.127
JUST PUT ON YOUR SIREN,
I'LL BE RIGHT THERE.
只要拉上你的警笛，
我马上就到。

09:20.193 --> 09:28.201
( imitating weak siren )
（模仿弱海妖）

09:34.074 --> 09:36.476
( imitating loud siren )
（模仿响亮的警笛声）

09:36.543 --> 09:38.646
SPONGEBOB, I SEE HIM.
海绵宝宝，我看到他了。

09:38.712 --> 09:40.748
WHERE IS HE, PATRICK?
他在哪里，帕特里克？

09:40.814 --> 09:44.217
AT THE INTERSECTION
OF CONCH AND CORAL.
在十字路口
海螺和珊瑚。

09:46.086 --> 09:47.855
SpongeBob:
THAT'S WHERE I AM.
海绵宝宝：
这就是我所在的地方。

09:47.921 --> 09:50.423
HE'S RIGHT ON TOP OF ME,
BUT I CAN'T SEE HIM.
他就在我上面，
但我看不到他。

09:50.490 --> 09:51.491
WHAT'S HE DOING?
他在做什么？

09:51.558 --> 09:54.962
UH... HE'S JUST
STANDING THERE...
呃...他只是
站在那里……

09:55.028 --> 09:56.664
MENACINGLY!
威胁性的！

09:56.664 --> 09:58.699
Get out of there, SpongeBob!
离开那里，海绵宝宝！

09:58.766 --> 10:00.267
YAAH!
啊啊！

10:00.333 --> 10:02.169
THAT'S HIS MANIAC SHRIEK.
这就是他的疯狂尖叫声。

10:02.235 --> 10:03.737
HE'S GOING TO ATTACK.
他要进攻了。

10:03.804 --> 10:05.639
( whining and sobbing )
（呜咽和抽泣）

10:05.706 --> 10:07.207
He's acting all crazy.
他表现得很疯狂。

10:07.274 --> 10:08.308
RUN!
跑步！

10:08.375 --> 10:09.943
Hide behind that building.
躲在那栋大楼后面。

10:10.010 --> 10:11.645
No, he's behind that building.
不，他就在那栋大楼后面。

10:11.712 --> 10:13.613
Quick, hide behind
that street sign.
快躲到后面去
那个路牌。

10:13.681 --> 10:14.882
No, wait!
不，等等！

10:14.948 --> 10:16.917
The maniac just went
behind that sign.
疯子刚刚走了
那个标志后面。

10:16.984 --> 10:18.752
Quick, get under
the street light.
快点到下面去
路灯。

10:18.819 --> 10:19.753
No! wait!
不！等待！

10:19.820 --> 10:21.722
He's there, too!
他也在那儿！

10:21.789 --> 10:23.724
Run for your life!
为你的生命而奔跑！

10:23.791 --> 10:26.126
( screaming )
（尖叫）

10:26.193 --> 10:27.828
( sighs )
（叹气）

10:27.895 --> 10:30.931
( muffled radio transmission )
（低沉的无线电传输）

10:30.998 --> 10:32.900
SAY AGAIN, DEPUTY?
再说一遍，副手？

10:32.966 --> 10:36.569
THE MANIAC'S IN THE MAILBOX.
疯子在邮箱里。

10:36.636 --> 10:38.271
( screams )
（尖叫声）

10:39.773 --> 10:46.079
( screaming and babbling )
（尖叫声和胡言乱语）

10:59.026 --> 11:01.995
HUH-- THIS GUY'S NOT
HALF-BAD-LOOKING FOR A MANIAC.
嗯——这家伙不是
看起来有点像个疯子。

11:02.062 --> 11:03.897
WAIT A MINUTE, PATRICK.
等一下，帕特里克。

11:03.964 --> 11:06.033
I'M THE MANIAC.
我是疯子。

11:06.099 --> 11:08.235
( Patrick screams )
（帕特里克尖叫）

11:08.301 --> 11:09.602
( sirens wail )
（警报声）

11:11.038 --> 11:13.273
WE'LL TAKE THAT AS A CONFESSION.
我们会把这当作一种忏悔。

11:13.340 --> 11:16.509
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS,
THERE YOU ARE!
海绵宝宝，
你在那里！

11:16.576 --> 11:18.946
I TURN MY BACK ON YOU
FOR ONE MINUTE
我转身背对你
一分钟

11:19.012 --> 11:21.014
AND YOU DESTROY
HALF THE CITY!
而你摧毁了
半个城市！

11:21.081 --> 11:23.050
YOU SHOULD BE ASHAMED
OF YOURSELF.
你应该感到羞耻
你自己。

11:23.116 --> 11:24.417
YOU KNOW
THIS GUY?
你知道
这个家伙？

11:24.484 --> 11:25.986
OF COURSE I DO.
我当然愿意。

11:26.053 --> 11:29.089
I'M THE ONE WHO GAVE HIM
THE UNIFORM IN THE FIRST PLACE.
我是赐予他的人
首先是制服。

11:29.156 --> 11:32.492
HE'S MY RESPONSIBILITY.
他是我的责任。

11:32.559 --> 11:34.594
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

11:36.764 --> 11:39.266
Mrs. Puff:
AND IN CONCLUSION, STUDENTS
泡芙女士：
总之，学生们

11:39.332 --> 11:44.237
RED MEANS STOP,
GREEN MEANS GO.
红色表示停止，
绿色意味着前进。

11:44.304 --> 11:46.506
AND SPONGEBOB...
还有海绵宝宝...

11:46.573 --> 11:48.008
YES, MRS. PUFF?
是的，夫人。噗？

11:48.075 --> 11:50.610
I'D LIKE TO SEE YOU
AFTER CLASS
我想见你
课后

11:50.677 --> 11:53.781
SIX MONTHS FROM NOW.
六个月后。

11:53.814 --> 11:54.815
( door slams )
（关门声）

12:06.559 --> 12:10.163
AH, JELLYFISH FIELDS.
啊，水母田。

12:10.230 --> 12:13.033
HERE WE FIND SPONGEBOB
ONCE AGAIN
我们在这里找到海绵宝宝
再次

12:13.100 --> 12:16.269
STALKING THE WILD JELLYFISH.
追踪野生水母。

12:16.336 --> 12:17.805
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

12:17.838 --> 12:19.706
HELLO? SPONGEBOB?
你好？海绵宝宝？

12:19.807 --> 12:22.042
HMM-- HE'S SUPPOSED
TO BE HERE SOMEWHERE.
嗯——应该是他
来到这里的某个地方。

12:22.109 --> 12:23.210
AHA!
啊哈！

12:23.276 --> 12:25.512
( jellyfish buzzing like a bee )
（水母像蜜蜂一样嗡嗡作响）

12:26.613 --> 12:27.815
SAFETY FIRST.
安全第一。

12:33.720 --> 12:34.822
AHA!
啊哈！

12:34.888 --> 12:36.089
I FINALLY GOT YOU.
我终于找到你了。

12:39.692 --> 12:42.329
( splatting )
（溅）

12:42.395 --> 12:44.531
( jellyfish moos )
（水母哞哞叫）

12:46.533 --> 12:48.368
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

12:50.838 --> 12:54.241
( with French accent ):
AH, THERE IS NOTHING BETTER
THAN THE TASTE
（带有法国口音）：
啊，没有比这更好的了
比味道

12:54.307 --> 12:57.244
OF NATURAL JELLY
FROM A JELLYFISH.
天然果冻
来自水母。

12:58.411 --> 12:59.847
SEE YOU LATER!
稍后见！

13:01.548 --> 13:04.117
OH... OH, MY GLASSES.
哦...哦，我的眼镜。

13:04.184 --> 13:05.218
THANKS, LITTLE GUY.
谢谢，小家伙。

13:05.285 --> 13:06.353
BYE.
再见。

13:09.857 --> 13:12.459
I CAN'T PLAY ANYMORE, JELLYFISH.
我不能再玩了，水母。

13:12.525 --> 13:14.027
I GOT TO GET HOME.
我得回家了。

13:14.094 --> 13:16.229
NO, YOU CAN'T COME HOME WITH ME.
不，你不能和我一起回家。

13:19.566 --> 13:22.669
( steps squeaking
like SpongeBob's )
（脚步吱吱作响
就像海绵宝宝一样）

13:22.735 --> 13:24.604
JELLYFISH,
YOU'VE GOT TO STAY HERE.
水母，
你必须留在这里。

13:24.671 --> 13:25.605
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

13:25.672 --> 13:26.673
HEY!
嘿！

13:28.208 --> 13:29.209
STAY!
停留！

13:30.610 --> 13:31.945
STAY...
停留...

13:41.889 --> 13:44.958
( jellyfish giggling )
（水母咯咯笑）

13:45.025 --> 13:48.595
JELLYFISH, FOR THE LAST TIME,
YOU CANNOT COME HOME WITH ME!
水母，最后一次，
你不能和我一起回家！

13:50.530 --> 13:52.265
AW, WHAT THE HECK.
噢，到底是什么？

13:54.501 --> 13:57.637
SQUIDWARD, HEY, SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥，嘿，章鱼哥！

13:57.704 --> 13:59.039
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

13:59.106 --> 14:01.408
SQUIDWARDIARD!
鱿鱼王！

14:01.474 --> 14:03.343
SQUIDWARD, LOOK AT MY NEW PET.
章鱼哥，看看我的新宠物。

14:03.410 --> 14:06.179
THAT'S NO PET,
THAT'S A WILD ANIMAL.
那不是宠物，
那是野生动物。

14:06.246 --> 14:07.180
NO, HE ISN'T.
不，他不是。

14:07.247 --> 14:08.481
WATCH THIS.
注意这个。

14:08.548 --> 14:09.549
FETCH.
拿来。

14:10.583 --> 14:12.452
HOW MANY FINGERS
AM I HOLDING UP?
有多少根手指
我坚持住了吗？

14:12.519 --> 14:14.321
( hums deeply
three times )
（深深地哼了一声
三遍）

14:14.387 --> 14:15.222
PLAY DEAD.
假死。

14:15.288 --> 14:17.324
( bell tolls )
（钟声）

14:17.390 --> 14:19.426
I WOULDN'T LET THAT THING
IN MY HOUSE
我不会让那件事
在我家里

14:19.492 --> 14:21.161
EVEN IF IT WAS POTTY-TRAINED.
即使它受过如厕训练。

14:21.228 --> 14:24.397
( humming casually )
（随意哼哼）

14:24.464 --> 14:25.933
I DIDN'T NEED TO SEE THAT.
我不需要看到这个。

14:25.933 --> 14:27.534
WELL, WE'RE GOING
TO MY HOUSE
好吧，我们走了
到我家

14:27.600 --> 14:28.936
TO HAVE A LITTLE FUN.
享受一点乐趣。

14:30.737 --> 14:34.074
HOW CAN YOU POSSIBLY HAVE FUN
WITH A JELLYFISH?!
你怎样才能玩得开心
与水母？！

14:34.141 --> 14:38.278
( techno music
with heavy bass playing )
（科技音乐
重低音演奏）

15:04.404 --> 15:06.439
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:06.506 --> 15:08.175
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:08.241 --> 15:09.709
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:09.776 --> 15:12.045
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:12.112 --> 15:14.114
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:14.181 --> 15:15.882
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:15.983 --> 15:17.217
* HEY! *
* 嘿！ *

15:33.766 --> 15:40.307
( techno music
continues blasting )
（科技音乐
继续爆破）

15:40.373 --> 15:42.575
SPONGEBOB IS THE ONLY GUY I KNOW
海绵宝宝是我唯一认识的人

15:42.642 --> 15:45.178
THAT CAN HAVE FUN
WITH A JELLYFISH...
那可以很有趣
与水母...

15:45.245 --> 15:47.514
FOR 12 HOURS!
12 小时！

15:56.556 --> 15:58.925
UGH... WOW!
呃...哇！

15:59.026 --> 16:00.827
YOU SURE LIKE TO DANCE.
你肯定喜欢跳舞。

16:01.028 --> 16:02.729
WELL, THAT'S ENOUGH FOR TONIGHT.
好了，今晚就够了。

16:04.564 --> 16:06.033
IT'S TIME TO GO TO BED.
是时候去睡觉了。

16:06.066 --> 16:08.801
( jellyfish buzzing )
（水母嗡嗡声）

16:10.170 --> 16:11.404
( music blasting )
（音乐震耳欲聋）

16:11.471 --> 16:12.439
HUH?
嗯？

16:14.741 --> 16:16.776
YOU'VE GOT IT ALL WRONG,
LITTLE FELLOW.
你都错了，
小家伙。

16:16.843 --> 16:18.745
( music starts again )
（音乐再次响起）

16:18.811 --> 16:21.248
BED!
床！

16:21.314 --> 16:23.250
REPEAT AFTER ME, "BED."
跟着我重复一遍，“上床”。

16:23.316 --> 16:25.418
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

16:25.485 --> 16:27.520
WE'LL JUST KEEP YOU RIGHT HERE.
我们会让您留在这里。

16:27.587 --> 16:28.455
( meows )
（喵）

16:28.521 --> 16:29.722
QUIT WORRYING, GARY.
别担心，加里。

16:29.789 --> 16:30.957
HE'LL BE JUST FINE.
他会没事的。

16:31.058 --> 16:33.793
GOOD NIGHT, EVERYBODY.
大家晚安。

16:33.860 --> 16:38.065
( snoring )
（打鼾）

16:38.131 --> 16:42.669
( droning loudly )
（大声嗡嗡声）

16:42.735 --> 16:44.404
( snoring )
（打鼾）

16:48.941 --> 16:49.942
( meows )
（喵）

16:52.145 --> 16:56.816
( buzzing gibberish )
（嗡嗡作响的胡言乱语）

16:56.883 --> 16:58.651
( meows )
（喵）

16:58.718 --> 17:00.153
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

17:02.155 --> 17:03.223
( meows )
（喵）

17:06.093 --> 17:08.095
( rooster crows )
（公鸡打鸣）

17:08.128 --> 17:11.698
MMM... GOOD MORNING, GARY.
嗯……早上好，加里。

17:11.764 --> 17:13.800
GOOD MORNING, JELLYFISH.
早上好，水母。

17:13.866 --> 17:15.001
JELLYFISH?
海蜇？

17:15.102 --> 17:16.403
JELLYFISH?
海蜇？

17:16.469 --> 17:17.637
HERE, JELLYFISH!
在这里，水母！

17:19.606 --> 17:20.673
OH, JELLY!
哦，果冻！

17:25.278 --> 17:26.213
( meows wetly )
（湿漉漉地喵喵叫）

17:26.279 --> 17:27.580
OH, JELLYF...
哦，果冻……

17:27.647 --> 17:30.350
( yelling )
（大喊）

17:30.417 --> 17:33.120
( techno music playing )
（电子音乐播放）

17:33.186 --> 17:35.155
WHERE'D YOU ALL COME FROM?
你们都是从哪里来的？

17:49.702 --> 17:50.637
OKAY, THAT'S IT.
好的，就是这样。

17:50.703 --> 17:51.938
PARTY IS OVER!
派对结束了！

17:52.004 --> 17:54.474
YOU GUYS HAVE OVERSTAYED
YOUR WELCOME.
你们已经逾期居留了
欢迎您。

17:54.541 --> 17:56.909
THIS MUSIC IS WAY TOO LOUD.
这音乐太大声了。

17:56.976 --> 17:58.611
( screams )
（尖叫声）

17:58.678 --> 17:59.946
VERY FUNNY.
很搞笑。

18:02.215 --> 18:03.483
I'M SERIOUS.
我是认真的。

18:17.029 --> 18:18.765
( rumbling and crackling )
（隆隆声和噼啪声）

18:18.831 --> 18:20.333
( grumbling )
（抱怨）

18:20.400 --> 18:22.435
18 HOURS!
18小时！

18:24.671 --> 18:27.607
I'M GOING TO GIVE THAT
SPONGEBOB A PIECE OF MY MIND.
我要给出这个
海绵宝宝是我的心声。

18:27.674 --> 18:30.277
( phone ringing )
（电话铃声响起）

18:30.343 --> 18:31.644
( garbled ):
HELLO.
（乱码）：
你好。

18:31.711 --> 18:32.879
SpongeBob,
listen to me
海绵宝宝，
听我说

18:32.945 --> 18:34.881
you square-headed
assault on my ears.
你方头
攻击我的耳朵。

18:34.947 --> 18:37.884
I'VE HAD ENOUGH OF THIS!
我已经受够了！

18:37.950 --> 18:39.819
STRAWBERRY.
草莓。

18:39.886 --> 18:42.455
TWO CAN PLAY AT THIS.
两个人可以玩这个。

18:42.522 --> 18:43.656
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

18:43.723 --> 18:44.924
COME ON, GUYS
来吧，伙计们

18:44.991 --> 18:46.193
ENOUGH IS ENOUGH.
够了。

18:46.226 --> 18:47.927
HUH?
嗯？

18:47.994 --> 18:53.266
( clarinet playing squeaky
version of "Row Your Boat" )
（单簧管演奏吱吱作响
《划你的船》的版本）

18:53.333 --> 18:54.434
( screams )
（尖叫声）

18:54.501 --> 18:56.203
HEY, TAKE IT EASY! OW!
嘿，别紧张！噢！

18:56.203 --> 18:58.104
OKAY, I'LL TALK TO HIM.
好的，我会和他谈谈。

18:59.772 --> 19:01.841
SQUIDWARD,
WOULD IT BE POSSIBLE
章鱼哥，
有可能吗

19:01.908 --> 19:04.644
TO PLAY YOUR CLARINET
A LITTLE... BETTER?
演奏你的单簧管
稍微……好一点？

19:04.711 --> 19:07.214
I DON'T THINK
THE JELLYFISH LIKE IT.
我不认为
水母喜欢它。

19:07.214 --> 19:08.981
THE JELLYFISH DON'T LIKE...
水母不喜欢...

19:09.048 --> 19:13.653
WHA... WHY SURE, PAL,
I CAN PLAY BETTER.
哇...为什么当然，朋友，
我可以打得更好。

19:13.720 --> 19:15.788
OKAY, HE SAID HE'LL PLAY BETTER.
好吧，他说他会打得更好。

19:18.758 --> 19:20.960
( Squidward inhales deeply )
（章鱼哥深吸一口气）

19:21.027 --> 19:22.662
( playing loud, blaring note )
（大声演奏，响亮的音符）

19:22.729 --> 19:24.364
UH-OH, THAT'S NOT BETTER.
呃-哦，那不是更好。

19:24.431 --> 19:27.234
HEY, TAKE IT EASY WITH THAT!
嘿，别着急！

19:27.300 --> 19:31.371
( playing gurgly rendition
of "Row, Row, Row Your Boat" )
（播放咕咕的演奏
的“划，划，划你的船”）

19:33.773 --> 19:34.941
( clarinet squeaks )
（单簧管吱吱声）

19:35.007 --> 19:37.109
Squidward:
UH, WAIT--
I CAN TURN IT DOWN.
章鱼哥：
呃，等等——
我可以把它关掉。

19:37.244 --> 19:41.981
( Squidward yelling,
electricity crackling )
（章鱼哥大喊，
电噼啪声）

19:42.048 --> 19:43.250
( knock at door )
（敲门）

19:45.618 --> 19:47.320
EVERYBODY'S A CRITIC.
每个人都是批评家。

19:47.387 --> 19:50.022
YOU WON'T BE HEARING
FROM ME ANYMORE.
你不会听到
不再是我了。

19:51.758 --> 19:53.493
HEY, NOW, THAT WASN'T NICE.
嘿，现在，那不太好。

19:58.030 --> 19:59.632
( boat horn blows )
（船喇叭吹响）

19:59.699 --> 20:01.234
OKAY, THAT IS IT!
好的，就是这样！

20:01.301 --> 20:04.070
EVERYBODY OUT!
大家都出去！

20:07.840 --> 20:11.478
( groaning )
（呻吟）

20:12.879 --> 20:15.214
( groaning again )
（再次呻吟）

20:16.683 --> 20:17.750
( music stops )
（音乐停止）

20:17.817 --> 20:19.118
( gulps )
（咽了口口水）

20:19.185 --> 20:21.388
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

20:21.454 --> 20:22.755
UH, WAIT... HOLD ON.
呃，等等……等等。

20:22.822 --> 20:24.557
UH, WAIT.
呃，等等。

20:24.624 --> 20:25.625
OW, OW...
噢，噢……

20:25.692 --> 20:27.460
OW, OW, OW...
噢，噢，噢……

20:27.527 --> 20:29.396
( yelling )
（大喊）

20:29.462 --> 20:30.997
( electricity crackling )
（电噼啪声）

20:31.063 --> 20:33.199
( yelling )
（大喊）

20:36.403 --> 20:38.738
COME ON, GARY.
来吧，加里。

20:40.707 --> 20:42.809
( deep rumbling )
（深沉的隆隆声）

20:45.645 --> 20:47.980
GARY, YOU WERE RIGHT.
加里，你是对的。

20:48.047 --> 20:49.782
THANKS FOR NOT RUBBING IT IN.
感谢您没有摩擦它。

20:49.849 --> 20:52.251
( buzzing loudly )
（大声嗡嗡声）

20:52.319 --> 20:54.554
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

20:54.621 --> 20:56.956
( clicking )
（点击）

20:57.023 --> 20:58.391
HUH?
嗯？

21:01.894 --> 21:03.396
THEY STOPPED?
他们停下来了吗？

21:07.967 --> 21:09.336
( clicking )
（点击）

21:19.211 --> 21:22.782
GARY, DON'T STOP SHAKING IT!
加里，别停止摇晃！

21:32.825 --> 21:34.827
( jellyfish humming peacefully )
（水母安静地嗡嗡作响）

21:40.367 --> 21:43.370
( gurgling in tempo )
（节奏中咯咯作响）

21:46.573 --> 21:49.376
( rattling in tempo )
（节奏嘎嘎作响）

21:51.678 --> 21:53.480
( clicking in tempo )
（按节奏点击）

21:58.250 --> 22:01.388
( playing bass riff )
（演奏低音连复段）

22:04.624 --> 22:07.627
( singing )
（唱歌）

22:15.635 --> 22:17.303
( slide guitar playing )
（滑音吉他演奏）

22:17.404 --> 22:20.740
( trumpets join in )
（喇叭加入）

22:20.807 --> 22:23.410
( clicking )
（点击）

22:23.476 --> 22:27.146
( everybody strumming,
clicking, rattling or singing )
（大家都在弹奏，
咔哒声、嘎嘎声或歌唱）

22:45.598 --> 22:51.237
TODAY SPONGEBOB HAS LEARNED ONE
OF THE SEA'S HARSHEST LESSONS--
今天海绵宝宝学会了一个
大海最惨痛的教训——

22:51.303 --> 22:54.006
WILD ANIMALS CAN THROW
VERY WILD PARTIES.
野生动物可以扔东西
非常疯狂的派对。

22:54.073 --> 22:55.842
( screeching with pain )
（痛苦地尖叫）

22:55.908 --> 22:57.677
OOH, I FELT THAT.
哦，我感觉到了。

